 # projects-app
 
-Internal project tracker for one company.
+Multi-tenant project tracker. Every user belongs to one org (`orgId`); projects carry an `orgId`, tasks inherit theirs from their project, and every route is scoped to the caller's org. Admin is an org-level role.
